requirement OPS-RESPONSE-001
title: Detect and respond
statement:
  The vehicle shall detect a hazardous condition and issue a response within 100 ms.
rationale:
  Timely response limits exposure to the hazardous condition.
end requirement

requirement SYS-INGEST-001
title: Ingest condition data
statement:
  The control system shall ingest the condition data within 30 ms.
decomposes: OPS-RESPONSE-001
end requirement

requirement SYS-EVALUATE-001
title: Evaluate hazardous condition
statement:
  The control system shall evaluate the condition and select a response within 50 ms.
decomposes: OPS-RESPONSE-001
end requirement

requirement SYS-ACTUATE-001
title: Issue selected response
statement:
  The control system shall issue the selected response within 20 ms.
decomposes: OPS-RESPONSE-001
end requirement

requirement SW-SAMPLE-001
title: Sample condition input
statement:
  The input software shall provide a condition sample within 30 ms.
decomposes: SYS-INGEST-001
end requirement

requirement SW-DECIDE-001
title: Select response
statement:
  The decision software shall select the commanded response within 50 ms.
decomposes: SYS-EVALUATE-001
end requirement

requirement SW-COMMAND-001
title: Command response output
statement:
  The output software shall command the selected response within 20 ms.
decomposes: SYS-ACTUATE-001
end requirement
